<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64058" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύθρ-ον</span></b> , τό, or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύθρ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>defilement from
				blood, gore</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, only in dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύθρῳ . . παλάσσετο χεῖρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.169
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				20.503
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἵματι καὶ λύθρῳ πεπαλαγμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					6.268
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				22.402
			</span></i>: masc. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύθρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.323
				</span></i>
			 (Antip.), <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.268
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.46
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				3.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.71a
			</span></i>: the neut. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύθρον</span> only in <i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				4.112
			</span></i>: in Medic., of <i>the impure blood</i> in a woman's womb, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.496b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				997a
			</span></i>: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ μητρῴων λύθρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			; of <i>blood</i> in general, <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				2.2
			</span></i>; of the <i>venom</i> of the hydra, <i><span class="en">
				Euph.
				50.2
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ</span> by nature,
				<u>APl.</u>l.c., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				314
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Smyrna</span>).]</div>
